message: "If you use these tools or notes, please cite them as below."
title: "how-sure: small tools and notes from a petroleum geologist's work"
abstract: "Small tools and notes from my work as a petroleum geologist. Each one deals with the same question: how sure are we, and what would make us surer? Tool 01 is a post-drill look-back template in Excel (prediction vs. result) with a hand-worked example and 32 checks. Tool 02 is an interactive page that checks a planned magnetic survey against one geological question (a dyke, a sill edge or a plug: visible or not, one anomaly or two, line spacing), with 24 checks against known answers."
type: software
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
